  "reference": "2 Abaruchi 12",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwomusaafu kwaYehu, Yehoashi yachaaka okhuruka, naruchila eYerusalemu emiyika amakhumi kane; ne eliira lianyina liali Zibia, oweBeeri-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yehoashi yakhola akali amalayi mumoni tsiOMWAMI tsindaalotsie tsiosi, shichila Yehoyada omukuhani yamwechesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula habundu aheechingu hosi shiharusibwaho ta; abandu bali nibashimalilanga emisango nibasambila amalesi kelibuuliesi habundu aheechingu tsana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yehoashi yasunjila abakuhani ari Amapeesa kosi kebindu ebitakatifu akaleerungwa munzu yOMWAMI, amapeesa tsana aka buli mundu aroosibwa, niko amapeesa kabandu aka buli mundu abasilibwa, halala namapeesa aka omwoyo kwomundu yesi kumwibaalila okhuleera munzu yOMWAMI, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akeenako abakuhani bakabukule, buli mundu khubandu aba yamanya; nibakasilia ahaba nihabiiyile khunzu, buli hosi ahaba nihalolekha nahabii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa kamala nikaba mbu mumuyika kwamakhumi kabili nakhataru kwo-muruchi Yehoashi, abakuhani shibali nibakasiyekhwo inzu aha yabiiha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Yehoashi nalanga Yehoyada omukuhani, nende abakuhani bandi, nabareeba mbu Mbushiina nimurakasinjia inzu aha yabiiha ta? Kho bulaano murabukulakhwo khandi amapeesa mubandu aba mumanyile ta; nebutswa mukahaane khulwa inzu aha yabiiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakuhani nibeeyama mbu shibakhabukulakhwo amapeesa mubandu khandi ta, kata okhukasinjia inzu aha yabiiha tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yehoyada omukuhani nabukula lisanduku, nafutula omuluhu mushifuunikho shialio, nalirenjekha hashimalio, khulubeka Iwomukhono musaatsa noli owinjila munzu yOMWAMI, nabo abakuhani abalindanga omuliango bareetsangamwo amapeesa kosi akaleerungwa munzu yOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa balolanga mbu amapeesa akali mwisanduku namanji, kho omuhandiichi womuruchi nende omukuhani omukhulundu batikulukhanga nibakaboha muloloti, nibabasia amapeesa akanyoolekha munzu yOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana bahaananga amapeesa akachelilwe mumakhono ka abo abakhola emilimo chiene, abasinjililanga inzu yOMWAMI; nabo nibakakabilanga ababaatsi naboombashi abakholanga inzu yOMWAMI, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende aboombashilanga amachina, nababaatsi bamachina; nokhukula emisaala namachina amabaatse okhukasia inzu yOMWAMI aha yibiiyile, kata khulwa biosi ebienyeshela inzu khulwa okhuchikasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa ebikombe bieifeetsa, kata amahana akokhusimilia tsitaha, kata tsindaabo, kata tsitarumbeta, kata ebimanulwa bieitsahaabu kata ebimanulwa bieifeetsa, shibiakholelwa inzu yOMWAMI namapeesa ako akaleerungwa munzu yOMWAMI ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba ako baheelesinjia abakhola emilimo chiene, nibakakasilia inzu yOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shibakabasia nende abandu abo aba bahaana amapeesa mumakhono kabwe okhubaheelesia abakholi bemilimo ta; okhuba bo bakholanga nobwisiikwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amapeesa kemisango chieshiuku, namapeesa kemisango chiobwonooni, shikaleerwa munzu yOMWAMI ta; ako kali akabakuhani beene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio Hazaeli omuruchi waSiria yatikulukha naseera Gatsi, nalibukula; mana Hazaeli nachoomia tsimoni eYerusalemu, okhutikulukhayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yehoashi omuruchi waYuda yabukula ebindu ebitakatifu biosi ebia Yehoshafati, naYehoramu, naAhazia, abakuukanyene, abaruchi baYuda, bali nibaahula, nende ebitakatifu bibie omwene, neitsahaabu yosi eyanyoolekha mumabiishilo keinzu yOMWAMI, nakomunzu yomuruchi, nayilila Hazaeli omuruchi waSiria; naye narula eYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amakhuwa kandi kaYoashi, nende kosi aka yakhola, shikahandiikwa muShitabu shiAmakhuwa keTsindaalo akabaruchi baYuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abasumbabe babuukha, nibamusanjilila nibamwirila Yoashi enanzu yaMilo, khunjila yeSila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Yozakari waShimeatsi naYehozabadi waShomeri, abasumbabe, bamuupa, nafwa; nibamuyabila halala nabakuukanyene mwitookho liaDaudi; naye Amazia omwanawe naruka mushilenjeshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
